
@host = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Cadastro
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "maria@example.com",
  "password": "senha-forte-123",
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25"
}

### 2. Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@example.com",
  "password": "senha-forte-123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Abrir conta corrente
# @name conta
POST {{host}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "CORRENTE" }

###
@accountId = {{conta.response.body.id}}

### 4. Abrir poupança
# @name poupanca
POST {{host}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "POUPANCA" }

###
@savingsId = {{poupanca.response.body.id}}

### 5. Depósito (repita a MESMA chave: a resposta é idêntica e o saldo não muda de novo)
POST {{host}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/deposits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: dep-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 1000.00, "description": "Depósito inicial" }

### 6. Saque
POST {{host}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/withdrawals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: saq-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100.50, "description": "Saque" }

### 7. Transferência para a poupança
POST {{host}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: trf-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": {{accountId}},
  "targetAccountId": {{savingsId}},
  "amount": 250.00,
  "description": "Reserva"
}

### 8. Saldo
GET {{host}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Extrato paginado com filtro de período (datas ISO, UTC)
GET {{host}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/statement?from=2026-01-01&to=2030-12-31&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Reconciliação (saldo materializado x ledger)
GET {{host}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/reconciliation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Minhas contas
GET {{host}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
